Are you buying your first barefoot shoes? Add a FREE educational brochure to your cart. Read more here.
High barefoot shoes that took inspiration from the legendary high Converse in the autumn / winter variant. Your feet will be comfortable, stay warm and dry, and still maintain your style.&nbsp;&nbsp;
Compared&nbsp;to ORIK&nbsp;shoes, OLEN&nbsp;is&nbsp;tougher&nbsp;against&nbsp;bad&nbsp;weather, has a&nbsp;new&nbsp;non-slip sole,&nbsp;warm&nbsp;vegan&nbsp;fur&nbsp;inside, and&nbsp;is&nbsp;made&nbsp;of&nbsp;Japanese&nbsp;microfiber&nbsp;suede&nbsp;Ultrasuede®.&nbsp;&nbsp;
The upper material is vegan microfiber suede Ultrasuede® from the Japanese company TORAY. It is made of recycled polyester, i.e. recycled PET bottles, which can then be further recycled. It is one of the most ecological substitutes for leather. The shoes are suitable for vegans.&nbsp;
The zipper on the side of the shoe makes it easy to put on and take off without bothering with the laces.
This&nbsp;model&nbsp;meets&nbsp;the&nbsp;standards&nbsp;of&nbsp;barefoot&nbsp;shoes&nbsp;-&nbsp;they&nbsp;have&nbsp;enough&nbsp;space&nbsp;for&nbsp;the&nbsp;toes, have a flexible and&nbsp;thin sole, zero&nbsp;drop and are&nbsp;light.&nbsp;&nbsp;
All&nbsp;our&nbsp;products&nbsp;are "PETA&nbsp;Approved&nbsp;Vegan"&nbsp;certified.&nbsp;&nbsp;
Produced ethically and ecologically with a high proportion of handicrafts done in the Europe.

